---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-cream-200 bg-white px-6 py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
      <span
        class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-ember-600 to-ember-400 font-display text-sm font-black text-white"
        >F</span
      >
      <span class="font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-bark-900">FIX</span>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Tecnología, IA y Marketing a medida para tu negocio.</p>

    <p class="text-sm text-faint">© {year} FIX. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
